    "sections": {
        "description": "The Maintenance Works Theme is designed for service providers, technicians, contractors, and facility management businesses, offering a structured layout suitable for presenting services related to building maintenance. It includes organized sections that allow users to clearly display repair services, service categories, and essential business information in a straightforward manner. The theme supports dedicated areas for highlighting routine maintenance offerings, helping visitors understand ongoing service options. It also provides space to present emergency repair solutions in a clear and accessible format. With layouts adaptable to property maintenance businesses, the design remains consistent across different service types. The theme structure accommodates content related to facility maintenance, enabling efficient presentation of operational details. It features responsive design support for desktops, tablets, and mobile devices, along with compatibility for common plugins and customization settings. Pre-built sections for testimonials, service listings, and project showcases are included to assist in content organization. The codebase follows SEO-friendly practices and optimized loading performance, while support for appointment booking plugins allows integration of scheduling features for maintenance-related services."
    },
